 "note": "M, 15 platforms, choke, inward. Two spiral arms: from each home a long bridge rises and hooks round (two Curve_45s) into the centre from the side. The centre is a switch whose bridges reach the top and bottom platforms (state 1) or the two diagonal platforms (state 2); the arms are fixed. Each home also has a long deck to the far crossing platform - the second lane. Point-symmetric: the arms read as a two-armed galaxy. Survivor ring: the switch and its four platforms.",
